; 4_voice_get_ready — SSG voice approximation: "GET READY!"
;
; Plain SSG notes — no envelope directives (K/Q/Y), so the standard
; reverted driver can parse this without falling through to garbage
; bytes.  Cadence + pitch contour approximates the spoken phrase:
;
;   GET   = short low-mid burst
;   REA-  = sustained rising vowel
;   -DY   = descending close
;   !     = high accent

T220
P0
V12
O4
L16

D F+ A4
E G B8
C E G4
> C2

~
